{title: Tere Liye (7 Khoon Maaf)}
{artist: Vishal Bharadwaj Suresh Wadkar}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F] Tere liye [A#] tere liye,        [Dm] tere liye [F] tere liye
[A#] Lafzon mein, [F] lamhon ki,        [Gm] doliyan, [F] laaye hain
[F] Lafzon mein, [Dm] lamhon ki,        [Fm] doliya [A#] laye hai laye [C] lhai
[F] Sheron mein, [Dm] khushboo ki,        [Gm] boliya [A#] laye hai laye [C] lhai
[F] Humne sau [A#] saude kiye,        [Dm] tere liye [F] tere liye
[F] Aankhon mein na chubhe,        [G] taaron [C] ki [F] kirchiyan
[F] Sheeshe ka aasma [G] laaye hain,        [C] tere [F] liye
[Dm] tere liye [F] Taare jade,        [C] heeron se bhi [G] kitne badey
[Gm] Humne aas [Dm] mano mein,        [F] lakhon ke saude [C] kiye
[F] Tere liye [A#] tere liye,        [Dm] tere liye [F] tere liye
[Dm] Halki si sardiyan,        [G] aur saans [A#] garm [F] ho
[Dm] Shaamon ki shawl bhi,        [G] thodi si, [A#] narm [F] ho
[Dm] Tere liye [F] kishmish chune,        [C] piste chune, [G] tere liye
[Gm] Humne toh [Dm] parindo se,        [F] baagon ke saude [C] kiye
[F] Tere liye [A#] tere liye,        [Dm] tere liye [F] tere liye
